#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "{2}\n"
#| "We've compiled some custom rules and best practices to enhance your gaming experience.\n"
#| "Keep in mind that these are just the \\textbf{opinions of the authors} of this book.\n"
#| "Enjoy!\n"
#| "\n"
msgid ""
"{2}\n"
"We've compiled some custom rules and best practices for fair competitive play.\n"
"They are intended for Clash Scenarios, where they reduce randomness and the luck factor.\n"
"Keep in mind that these are just the \\textbf{opinions of the authors} of this book.\n"
"Enjoy!\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"{2}\n"
"Nous avons compilé certaines règles maison et des bonnes pratiques pour améliorer votre expérience de jeu.\n"
"Gardez à l'esprit que ce ne sont que les \\textbf{opinions des auteurs} de ce livre.\n"
"Amusez vous bien!\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Magic Arrows}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Flèche Magique}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Except for the Magic Arrow, each Spell appears exactly twice in the Spell Deck.\n"
"After players prepare their starting M\\&M Decks, it is recommended to remove Magic Arrows from the Spell Deck until no more than two remain.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"À l'exception de Flèche Magique, chaque sort est en double dans le Deck Sort.\n"
"Après la préparation du Deck de Départ M\\&M des joueurs, il est recommandé de retirer les Flèches Magiques du Deck Sort pour n'en laisser que deux.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Guaranteed Settlement}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Enclave Garantie}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When distributing Far Tiles (II--III) between players, each player's pool of Map Tiles must include one Settlement.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"À la distribution des Tuiles Lointaines (II--III), chaque joueur doit avoir au moins une Tuile avec une Enclave.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Round One Mulligan}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Mulligan Manche 1}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On your turn in the \\nth{1} Round, discard any number of Cards from your hand, then draw up to your draw limit as normal.\n"
"After that, you may discard your whole hand and draw up to your draw limit again.\n"
"You can do this only once.\n"
"Unlike the Mulligan in Tournament Mode, you do not shuffle any Cards back into your Deck.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Tier V--VII Combat on Hard$+$\\\\Difficulty}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Combat Rang V--VII Combat en Difficulté$+$\\\\Difficile}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Treat Level V--VII Combats as one difficulty step lower when playing on Hard or Impossible.\n"
"For example, a Level VII Combat on Hard will be against 2 × \\svg{azure} Neutral Units.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Les Combats de Rang V--VII sont considérés comme un Rang de moins en Difficile ou Impossible.\n"
"Par exemple, un Combat de Rang VII en Difficile serait contre 2 × Unités Neutres \\svg{azure}.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Trading Post}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Comptoir}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Although rules as written state that you can remove only one Card from your hand while Visiting a Trading Post, it is recommended to allow removing as many as you like.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Bien que les règles indiquent que vous pouvez retirer une seule Carte de votre main en Visitant un Comptoir, il est recommandé de permettre d'en retirer autant que l'on veut.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Victory Points}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Points de Victoire}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When playing with the optional Victory Points from the Tournament book, the following rules apply (unless overruled by the Scenario):\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item Faction Towns grant 1 VP.\n"
"  \\item Possessing the Grail at the end of the match grants 3 VPs. If the Grail was transported to that player's Faction Town, it grants 5 VPs instead.\n"
"  \\item Capturing a Dragon Utopia grants 3 VPs.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"En jouant avec les Points de Victoire optionnels du Livre de Tournoi, les règles suivantes s'appliquent (sauf règle contraire du Scénario):\n"
"\\begin{itemize}\n"
"  \\item La Ville de Faction donne 1 VP.\n"
"  \\item Posséder le Graal à la fin de la partie donne 3 VPs. Si le Graal a été déposé dans la Ville de Faction donne à la place 5 VPs .\n"
"  \\item Capturer les Terres Désolées donne 3 VPs.\n"
"\\end{itemize}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\subsection*{Combat with Neutral Units}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\\subsection*{Combat avec Unités Neutres}\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"During Combat with Neutral Units in Clash Scenarios, if a player decides to deploy their Units only on one half (left or right) of the Combat Board, the player positioning the Neutral Units must do the same.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Durant un Combat avec des Unités Neutres en Scénarios Affrontement, si le joueurs décide de déployer ses Unités d'un seul côté (gauche ou droite) du Plateau de Combat, le joueurs déployant les Unités Neutres doit faire pareil.\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols*
#: sections/competitive_play.tex:53
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Placing Neutral Units far apart only makes the other player waste \\svg{movement}, which slows the game down.\n"
"The exception to this rule is when there are three Neutral \\svg{unit_ground} or \\svg{unit_flying} Units to position, as all of them must go to the front line.\n"
"See examples that follow.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Placer les Unités Neutres éloignées ne fait que gaspiller un \\svg{movement} par l'autre joueur, ce qui rallonge le jeu.\n"
"L'exception à cette règle est lorsqu'il y a trois Unités Neutres \\svg{unit_ground} ou \\svg{unit_flying} à déployer, car elles sont placées en ligne de front.\n"
"Voir les exemples suivants.\n"
"\n"

